OL,3,GNEWSAGuide dogs visit haunted house
OL,4,Aevent to prepare them for Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of trainee guide dogs have been
OL,7,Fgiven a special tour of a haunted house
OL,8,Fto prepare them for their first
OL,9,FHowl-oween.
OL,11,FThe canines, from charity Guide Dogs
OL,12,Ffor the Blind, visited the Grade-I
OL,13,Flisted St John's House in Warwick on
OL,14,FWednesday, to help them stay calm
OL,15,Faround spooky sights and sounds.
OL,17,FThe mansion, which is open to the
OL,18,Fpublic until Saturday evening, has been
OL,19,Fdressed up with Halloween decorations
OL,20,Fas part of its Haunted House family
OL,21,Ftrail event.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
