OL,3,GNEWSAGuide dogs visit haunted house
OL,4,Aevent to prepare them for Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the trainee guide dogs tackled a few
OL,7,Ffrightening sights and sounds, Guide
OL,8,FDogs trainer Chris Roberts explained
OL,9,Fhow the visit was designed to build
OL,10,Ftheir confidence.
